Summary
Question	Answer
Who maintains STOMP subscriptions?	Spring's SimpleBroker
Does it use my Room entity?	❌ No
Does it use my MongoDB?	❌ No
What does it store?	WebSocket sessions and subscribed destinations
What is /topic?	Broadcast (one sender → many subscribers)
What is /queue?	Private or point-to-point messaging, usually with convertAndSendToUser()
Who manages room membership?	Your application (MongoDB + services)
Who manages subscriptions?	The STOMP client and Spring's broker together